      "formula_id": "math:inner-product-induced-norm-proof:006",
      "source_latex": "\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:inner-product-norm-triangle-calculation}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\|x+y\\|^2&=(x+y,x+y)\\\\\n&=(x,x)+(x,y)+(y,x)+(y,y)\\\\\n&\\leq\\|x\\|^2+2\\|x\\|\\|y\\|+\\|y\\|^2\\\\\n&=(\\|x\\|+\\|y\\|)^2.\n\\end{aligned}\n\\end{equation}",
